        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "(Required) The ID of the managed node targeted by the command. A [[p0]]managed node[[p1]] can be an Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) instance, edge device, and on-premises server or VM in your hybrid environment that is configured for Amazon Web Services Systems Manager.",
      "protected": [
