        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The name of the step for which you want detailed results. If the document contains only one step, you can omit the name and details for that step. If the document contains more than one step, you must specify the name of the step for which you want to view details. Be sure to specify the name of the step, not the name of a plugin like [[p0]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "aws:RunShellScript"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To find the [[p0]] , check the document content and find the name of the step you want details for. Alternatively, use ListCommandInvocations with the [[p1]] and [[p2]] parameters. The [[p3]] is the [[p4]] attribute of the [[p5]] object in the [[p6]] list.",
      "protected": [
        {
