    {
      "id": "s0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The name of the CloudWatch Logs log group where you want to send command output. If you don’t specify a group name, Amazon Web Services Systems Manager automatically creates a log group for you. The log group uses the following naming format:",
      "protected": []
